WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.736 --> 00:00:07.471
&gt;&gt; Tucker: WELCOME TO "TUCKER

00:00:07.104 --> 00:00:09.539
CARLSON TONIGHT."

00:00:07.604 --> 00:00:09.840
THE LONG NATIONAL NIGHTMARE IS

00:00:09.673 --> 00:00:11.341
OVER.

00:00:09.973 --> 00:00:13.477
WE ARE HAPPY TO REPORT.

00:00:11.475 --> 00:00:13.844
PAUL MANAFORT IS BEHIND BARS

00:00:13.610 --> 00:00:16.613
TONIGHT.

00:00:13.977 --> 00:00:20.083
THE 69-YEAR-OLD LOBBYIST WAS

00:00:16.747 --> 00:00:22.619
DRAGGED TO PRISON ON THE ORDER

00:00:20.217 --> 00:00:25.289
OF THE FEDERAL JUDGE.

00:00:22.753 --> 00:00:27.391
THE PRESIDENT TWEETED ABOUT

00:00:25.422 --> 00:00:27.925
MANAFORT'S IMPRISONMENT EARLIER

00:00:27.524 --> 00:00:31.094
TODAY.

00:00:28.058 --> 00:00:35.832
WOW, A TOUGH SENTENCE FOR PAUL

00:00:31.228 --> 00:00:35.248
MANAFORT

00:00:35.248 --> 00:00:37.034
MANAFOR

00:00:35.966 --> 00:00:39.236
MANAFORT.

00:00:37.167 --> 00:00:43.073
WHAT ABOUT?

00:00:39.369 --> 00:00:43.941
THAT'S THE PRESIDENT'S VIEW.

00:00:43.206 --> 00:00:46.343
ON THE OTHER HAND, WITH MANAFORT

00:00:44.074 --> 00:00:46.877
IN A CAGE, THE REST OF US CAN

00:00:46.476 --> 00:00:47.744
RELAX.

00:00:47.010 --> 00:00:49.413
UNCHAIN THE DOOR.

00:00:47.878 --> 00:00:53.016
LET THE KIDS PLAY IN THE YARD.

00:00:49.546 --> 00:00:53.350
TAKE THE FIRST DEEP BREATH IN

00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:55.719
DECADES.

00:00:53.483 --> 00:00:56.019
IT'S A NEW DAY AMERICA, WE ARE

00:00:55.852 --> 00:00:59.723
SAFE.

00:00:56.153 --> 00:01:03.694
WE HAVE BAD NEWS AS WELL.

00:00:59.856 --> 00:01:05.696
PAUL MANAFORT'S CRIME WAS

00:01:03.827 --> 00:01:08.231
VIOLATING THE FOREIGN AGENT'S

00:01:05.829 --> 00:01:10.467
REGISTRATION ACT PASSED IN 1938.

00:01:08.365 --> 00:01:14.204
ADVANCING THE INTEREST OF A

00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:17.774
FOREIGN COUNTRY WITHOUT

00:01:14.338 --> 00:01:18.608
REGISTERING WITH THE U.S. IS A

00:01:17.908 --> 00:01:21.545
FELONY.

00:01:18.742 --> 00:01:26.416
THAT MEAN MANY OF THE PEOPLE IN

00:01:21.678 --> 00:01:32.923
WASHINGTON WILL HEAD TO JAIL.

00:01:26.550 --> 00:01:35.292
PODESTA AND BOTH CLINTONS AND

00:01:33.056 --> 00:01:36.059
UNNI-VISION TAKE MONEY FROM

00:01:35.425 --> 00:01:36.760
FOREIGN INTERESTS.

00:01:36.193 --> 00:01:38.428
THE LAW IS CLEAR.

00:01:36.893 --> 00:01:39.629
THEY ARE HEADED TO THE BIG

00:01:38.562 --> 00:01:40.931
HOUSE.

00:01:39.763 --> 00:01:42.065
ALL OF THEM.

00:01:41.064 --> 00:01:44.101
BEST OF LUCK.

00:01:42.199 --> 00:01:46.236
MANAFORT WAS ALSO ACCUSED OF

00:01:44.234 --> 00:01:48.372
TRYING TO INFLUENCE WITNESSES IN

00:01:46.370 --> 00:01:50.807
THE CASE AGAINST HIM.

00:01:48.505 --> 00:01:53.577
THAT'S SERIOUS AND POSSIBLY THE

00:01:50.941 --> 00:01:53.944
GOVERNMENT WILL PROVE IT AT

00:01:53.710 --> 00:01:54.745
TRIAL.

00:01:54.077 --> 00:01:57.014
TONIGHT PAUL MANAFORT HASN'T

00:01:54.878 --> 00:01:59.449
BEEN CONVICTED OF ANY CRIME.

00:01:57.147 --> 00:01:59.750
HE IS STILL INNOCENT, BUT NOW IN

00:01:59.583 --> 00:02:01.118
JAIL.

00:01:59.883 --> 00:02:03.887
THAT MIGHT BE JUSTIFIED IF

00:02:01.251 --> 00:02:05.389
MANAFORT WAS A THREAT TO PUBLIC

00:02:04.021 --> 00:02:07.257
SAFETY OR ANYONE CONSIDERED HIM

00:02:05.522 --> 00:02:09.726
A FLIGHT RISK.

00:02:07.391 --> 00:02:10.093
LATE MIDDLE AGE WITH NO

00:02:09.860 --> 00:02:11.228
PASSPORT.

00:02:10.227 --> 00:02:12.963
LET'S BE HONEST.

00:02:11.361 --> 00:02:14.231
PAUL MANAFORT IS IN JAIL BECAUSE

00:02:13.096 --> 00:02:15.399
PROSECUTORS WANT HIM TO TESTIFY

00:02:14.364 --> 00:02:16.533
AGAINST THE PRESIDENT.

00:02:15.532 --> 00:02:19.302
THEY ARE SWEATING HIM.

00:02:16.666 --> 00:02:21.471
NO RUBBER HOSES OR TRUCK

00:02:19.436 --> 00:02:21.838
BATTERIES, BUT THE POINT IS THE

00:02:21.605 --> 00:02:24.875
SAME.

00:02:21.972 --> 00:02:25.709
PROSECUTORS WANT TO INFLUENCE A

00:02:25.008 --> 00:02:30.013
POTENTIAL WITNESS IN THIS CASE.

00:02:25.842 --> 00:02:32.382
AS YESTERDAY'S IG REPORT SHOWED,

